1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,550
Bankadagi bir sana «xavfsiz» deydi, boshqasi «mazali».

2
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,110
Ular bir xil emas.

3
00:00:06,610 --> 00:00:07,590
Tasavvur qiling:

4
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:10,550
do'konga kirdingiz, bir banka konserva oldingiz.

5
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:13,110
Sanani ko'rdingiz va xotirjam bo'ldingiz.

6
00:00:13,610 --> 00:00:16,020
Lekin bu sana aslida nimani bildiradi?

7
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:20,100
Birinchidan, yozuvlarning farqini bilib oling.

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:25,580
Tayyorlangan sana — mahsulot qachon ishlab chiqarilganini ko'rsatadi.

9
00:00:25,580 --> 00:00:29,640
Yaroqlilik muddati — shu sanagacha mahsulot xavfsiz.

10
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:32,740
«Eng yaxshi sifatgacha» — bu sifat sanasi.

11
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:36,590
Muddati o'tgan mahsulotni yemang.

12
00:00:37,090 --> 00:00:40,520
Ikkinchidan, quruq mahsulotga ham ishonavermang.

13
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:49,320
Guruch, makaron va un to'g'ri saqlansa uzoq turadi, lekin namlik va hasharotlar ularni muddatidan oldin buzishi mumkin.

14
00:00:49,820 --> 00:00:51,860
Uchinchidan, bankaga qarang.

15
00:00:51,860 --> 00:00:57,290
Shishgan, oqayotgan, qattiq zanglagan yoki choklari shikastlangan bo'lsa, yemang.

16
00:00:57,790 --> 00:00:59,040
Eng xavflisi botulizm:

17
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:02,070
og'ir zaharlanishga olib keladigan kasallik.

18
00:01:02,070 --> 00:01:04,750
Xavfli konserva ba'zan tashqaridan bilinmaydi.

19
00:01:04,750 --> 00:01:07,970
Shuning uchun shubhali konservani tatib ko'rib tekshirmang.

20
00:01:08,470 --> 00:01:11,690
To'rtinchidan, sut mahsulotlari.

21
00:01:11,690 --> 00:01:16,520
Hidi yoki ko'rinishi o'zgargan bo'lsa, ichmang.

22
00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:22,640
Hid normal bo'lsa ham, bu to'liq xavfsizlikni kafolatlamaydi.

23
00:01:23,140 --> 00:01:25,300
Do'konda esa uchta ish qiling.

24
00:01:25,300 --> 00:01:26,600
Sanani tekshiring.

25
00:01:26,600 --> 00:01:29,400
Qadoq butunligiga ishonch hosil qiling.

26
00:01:29,400 --> 00:01:31,560
Saqlash shartlariga amal qiling.

27
00:01:32,060 --> 00:01:35,220
Arzon ekan deb shubhali mahsulotni sotib olmang.

28
00:01:35,220 --> 00:01:39,750
Pulni tejash mumkin, lekin sog'liqni xavf ostiga qo'yishga arzimaydi.

29
00:01:40,250 --> 00:01:43,680
Mahsulot yorlig'ining suratini botimizga yuboring:

30
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,590
@sahiychishopbot.

31
00:01:44,590 --> 00:01:49,650
Yozuvlar nimani bildirishini tushuntirib, tekshirishni bosqichma-bosqich o'rgatadi.

32
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:52,980
Videoni yaqinlaringizga ham yuboring:

33
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:55,810
balki kimnidir jiddiy xatodan asrab qolar.

